 63686                           ;	ZCD Disable bit
 63687                           ;	ZCD = OFF, ZCD module is disabled. ZCD can be enabled by setting the ZCDSEN bit of ZCD
      +                          CON
 63688                           ;	PPSLOCK bit One-Way Set Enable bit
 63689                           ;	PPS1WAY = OFF, PPSLOCKED bit can be set and cleared repeatedly (subject to the unlock 
      +                          sequence)
 63690                           ;	Stack Full/Underflow Reset Enable bit
 63691                           ;	STVREN = ON, Stack full/underflow will cause Reset
 63692                           ;	Low Voltage Programming Enable bit
 63693                           ;	LVP = OFF, HV on MCLR/VPP must be used for programming
 63694                           ;	Extended Instruction Set Enable bit
 63695                           ;	XINST = OFF, Extended Instruction Set and Indexed Addressing Mode disabled
 63696   300003                     	org	3145731
 63697   300003  D7                 	db	215
